### 1. Utworzenie nowego produktu (Zapis do bazy)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Myszka Logitech G Pro X",
  "price": 599.99,
  "stockQuantity": 15
}

### 2. Pobranie wszystkich produktów (Odczyt z bazy)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products

### 3. Złożenie zamówienia
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerEmail": "test@example.com",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "3bd13590-fff8-4de1-8f52-7bc2a3555284",
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

### 4. Próba zamówienia ponad stan
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerEmail": "test@example.com",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "3bd13590-fff8-4de1-8f52-7bc2a3555284",
      "quantity": 90
    }
  ]
}

### 5. Zmiana statusu na PAID
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/orders/7d018d81-e79f-4f36-9ec2-7efa49704c31/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "PAID"
}